| Sysroot | `/usr/x86_64-w64-mingw32/sys-root/mingw/` | Per K lines 50-58. windows.h present. |
| Default runtime | MSVCRT (`libmsvcrt.a` in sysroot) | Per K line 17, K line 114. |
