Searched by re-read of the visible lines (1-97 truncated): no Windows claim, no mention of `mingw`, no mention of `chs_rt_win32`, no mention of `emit_windows`, no `windows.h`. The only "Pin" mention is line 14: "Pin: v0.205.0-beta" — matches the audit pin. The build facts (C emit + gcc, LLVM, x86, aarch64, wasm) are POSIX build facts, not Windows. No over-claim; no under-claim.

`SHIPPED.oot` line 78: "Proved 2026-08-17 on `./bin/ooda` and `./oodac/oodac` rebuilt from tree sources" — a Linux x86_64 build, no Windows. Honest.

